# =====================================================================
# Release V089 -- Target model Phase 2b: reshape Input.Targets + rewrite Fact_Daily_Targets
# =====================================================================
# BREAKING (dev, deliberate -- user OK'd). Cuts the target DATA layer over to the new model:
#   * Input.Targets RESHAPED -> (Tenant, FY, Metric, Target_Level, Target_Value). Old Site/
#     Practitioner/Period shape dropped. Synced from AppDB.Input.Targets by the sync SP.
#   * Meta.usp_Sync_Input_From_AppDB (*03) now copies all 3 Input tables.
#   * Gold.Fact_Daily_Targets REWRITTEN -- grain (Tenant, fk_Date, Metric, Target_Level);
#     Daily_Target_Value (cumulative=annual/working-days, else annual) + Annual_Target_Value +
#     Variance (from Input.Metric_Variance). NHS UDA/UOA from contracts at Practice level.
#
# STILL TO DO (not in this manifest -- follow-ups):
#   - RETIRE the obsolete Fact_Targets + Fact_Effective_Targets + usp_Load_Targets (deactivate in
#     Process_Config); they read the OLD Input.Targets columns and will fail at runtime until then.
#   - Fact_NHS_Contract_Week also reads old Input.Targets -- repoint or retire.
#   - Wire Meta.usp_Sync_Input_From_AppDB into Orchestrate_Build (before dims/target facts).
#   - The MEASURES (tDaily/tEff) must be rewritten to read the new Fact_Daily_Targets (Target_Level
#     resolution by filter) -- user's Tabular Editor job. Until then the target cards are blank on dev.
#
# PREREQ: V086-V088. Break-dev acceptable; prod untouched.
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V089__target_model_reshape_targets_and_daily_fact.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

